# One file per line, whitespace separated:
#   group  target  repo  revision  path_in_repo  size_bytes  sha256
#
# group   image | video | mesh (select with download-models.sh --only GROUP)
# target  path relative to the ComfyUI models directory (<install root>/ComfyUI/models)
# repo    Hugging Face repo id; files are fetched from
#         https://huggingface.co/<repo>/resolve/<revision>/<path_in_repo>
# revision is a pinned commit so a rebuild gets byte identical files.
# See docs/model-choices.md for why each model was chosen.

